CM_ BO_ 0 "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. INFO-DIV CAN, 125000 bit/s; CAN ID 0x000. PSA-RE title: SEAT_CLIMATE_MODULE_STATUS_REAR_RIGHT. Brake unit status relayed by the body computer: brake fluid alert, hill-hold request, wheel pulse counters and start&stop brake demand. Source: https://github.com/prototux/PSA-RE/blob/67f7581e7622410efdbb29c7eda3b86982b9b450/buses/AEE2010.ev/LS.INFO-DIV/000.yml. Source sender alternatives: ICSV,BSI; physical TX/gateway forwarding not verified. Unresolved alternative source layouts preserved in source JSON. ";
CM_ SG_ 0 RawByte8 "RAW. PSA-RE bits 8.7-8.0. Unmapped/padding bits, no physical interpretation.";
CM_ SG_ 0 EspDisconnectRequest "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 7.0. ESP disconnection status requested by a diagnostic tool";
CM_ SG_ 0 BrakeAssistFaultLampRequest "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 7.1. Brake assist fault warning lamp activation request";
CM_ SG_ 0 StaticSlopeState "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 7.3-7.2. Static road slope state (uphill/downhill)";
CM_ SG_ 0 BrakeFunctionNeedForStartStop "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 7.5-7.4. Brake function requirement for the stop-start (STT) system";
CM_ SG_ 0 BrakeEcuPowerManagementFault "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 7.6. Electrical power management fault detected by the brake ECU";
CM_ SG_ 0 EmergencyBrakingSignaliza_517ee3 "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 7.7. Indicates whether the emergency braking signal function is implemented in the brake ECU";
CM_ SG_ 0 BatteryVoltageUcBrake "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 6.7-6.0. Battery voltage measured by the brake ECU Raw invalid=255; numeric DBC decoders may still scale it: check raw before use.";
CM_ SG_ 0 RearRightWheelSpinCounter "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 4.6-5.0. Free-running rear right wheel speed sensor pulse counter";
