CM_ BO_ 791 "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. INFO-DIV CAN, 125000 bit/s; CAN ID 0x317. PSA-RE title: CMB_CONFIG. Instrument cluster telltale lamp configuration: which fault/status indicators are fitted (ABS, ASR, steering assist, parking radar, battery, seatbelt, etc.). Source: https://github.com/prototux/PSA-RE/blob/67f7581e7622410efdbb29c7eda3b86982b9b450/buses/AEE2010.full/LS.INFO-DIV/317.yml. Source sender alternatives: CMB; physical TX/gateway forwarding not verified. VEHICLE_SOURCE_REVIEW: Owner reports original instrument cluster unit004 connected for info_buzeni_obc.csv and absent in earlier captures. This ID is absent in info_standby.csv and fully operational info_start_jizda.csv; upstream lists CMB among possible senders. Owner approved limiting IC attribution to these nine messages. Scope: Vehicle-specific sender attribution from installation report/capture comparison and compatible source alias; does not validate signal meanings or exclude gateway forwarding. Observed 410 frames in info_buzeni_obc.csv,info_charging.csv; DLCs [5]. SOURCE_DLC_MISMATCH: source 8, observed/exported 5. Fitting fields retained; additional bytes raw. Unresolved alternative source layouts preserved in source JSON. ";
