CM_ SG_ 794 ZevRangeDisplay "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 1.7-2.7. Zero-emission (ZEV) driving range to display (km) VEHICLE_SCALE_OBSERVED: Owner supplied MyOpel screenshot showing 57% SOC and 120 km for logs/info_soc57_refresh.csv. All45 SOC frames contain byte0=0x39 (57). 44 valid31A frames start 1E00, raw9-bit range60; one startup frame is FF80, unavailable511. Thus this operating point requires 2 km/count, not the pinned source factor1. See docs/range-calibration.md. Scope: Vehicle-specific linear scale correction anchored by one simultaneous app/capture reference. Other operating points, rounding, upper bounds and upstream alternative vehicles remain unvalidated; source JSON stays unchanged. Raw invalid=511; numeric DBC decoders may still scale it: check raw before use. Upstream default raw=511 (not necessarily valid data). Unresolved source alternatives: [{\"note\": \"Also observed with another scaling (factor 0.1)\", \"factor\": 0.1}]";
