CM_ SG_ 918 UnusedChargeHmiLow "DATABASE_CANDIDATE: physical interpretation unverified; capture/layout evidence reported separately. PSA-RE bits 1.1-1.0.  VEHICLE_CAPTURE_OBSERVED: info_charging.csv: first byte00 ->04 at1.940s, then0C at483.603s after160 deferred mode at480.965s; owner confirms continuous AC charging around2.5kW before delay. info_start_odlozeni.csv repeats00 ->04 ->0C. Driving capture uses01/03, yielding HMI0; preconditioning/standby captures yield0. AEE2010.full/HS.HS3/396.yml defines exactly1.4-1.2 as CHARGING_HMI_STATE. Other HS3 fields/DLC are not imported. Scope: Vehicle-specific reported-HMI candidate supported for observed0/1/3, not a physical-current measurement. States2/4 follow the corroborating HS3 source enum and are unobserved;5..7 remain unknown. Older low-SOC charging-named captures report0, so stale/default BSI data can disagree with physical charging until refresh. Preserve the original INFO definition and unused bits.";
